aim:UAG-3OD-V1.0 a mkg:AIM ;
    mkg:acronym "UAG-3OD-V1.0" ;
    mkg:apiProfile "Basic" ;
    mkg:description "3D Model Object Delivery: delivers a 3D scene to a device - a 3D renderer. It delivers the 3D Model (Basic 3D Model Object or 3D Model Object) together with the animation streams that drive it - Face Descriptors (facial animation) and Body Descriptors (body animation) - each on its own port, so further animation streams can be added independently. The objects stay typed to the device edge, where the device renders them (3D to 2D). Model and animation are inseparable at render time (posing is rendering). It renders a 3D Model Scene too: the Basic 3D Model Scene Descriptors (ModelScene) - 3D Model Objects, each with its Space-Time - as seen from the Point of View (PointOfView): the device places each object and looks at them from there." ;
    mkg:ofStandard standard:UAG ;
    mkg:port <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/UAG-3OD-V1.0/port/Input/OSD-3DO-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/UAG-3OD-V1.0/port/Input/OSD-3SD-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/UAG-3OD-V1.0/port/Input/OSD-B3O-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/UAG-3OD-V1.0/port/Input/OSD-B3S-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/UAG-3OD-V1.0/port/Input/OSD-OPV-V1.5/0>,
