        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/PAF-AVS-V1.6/port/Input/OSD-BVO-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/PAF-AVS-V1.6/port/Input/OSD-OSA-V1.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/PAF-AVS-V1.6/port/Input/PAF-PAV-V1.6/0>,
