        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/PAF-SAF-V1.6/port/Input/OSD-BTO-V1.5/2>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/PAF-SAF-V1.6/port/Input/OSD-SPO-V1.5/1>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/PAF-SAF-V1.6/port/Input/OSD-SPO-V1.5/2>,
