        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/MMC-EDP-V2.5/port/Output/MMC-EPS-V2.5/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/MMC-EDP-V2.5/port/Output/MMC-HMD-V2.5/0>,
